<title>UK: German inland gas oil rises, demand seen as fair.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil rises, demand seen as fair.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.7141)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     33.20/33.40     19.37/19.49   33.10/33.30</p>
<p> BREMEN		33.20/33.40     19.37/19.49   33.10/33.30</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    33.30/33.50     19.42/19.54   33.00/33.20</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   33.80/34.00     19.72/19.84   33.50/33.80</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   33.80/34.10     19.72/19.89   33.60/33.90</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  34.80/35.20     20.32/20.54   34.70/35.00</p>
<p>German inland gas oil was a touch firmer on Friday as IPE futures gained and demand was deemed fair. Traders said buying interest was still good compared with previous weeks, but nothing exceptional.-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8980</p>
</text>
